---
# clang-tidy config for activity-defaults-switcher.
#
# The check set is pinned explicitly. clang-tidy 23 made an empty check set
# fatal ("Error: no checks enabled.") before it analyses anything, so a run
# with no config at all fails on every file — including untouched ones. The
# pinned set also keeps the gate identical across the clang-tidy versions CI
# (Debian) and contributors (Homebrew LLVM) use.
#
# It is the compiler diagnostics plus the core static analyzer, matching what
# `make tidy` was effectively checking before. The analyzer's opt-in checks are
# excluded: they are not meant to run by default, and
# clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange fires on the deliberate
# out-of-range Component casts in tst_writer.cpp's robustness loop.
Checks: 'clang-diagnostic-*,clang-analyzer-*,-clang-analyzer-optin*'
